      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71365F8CFF0C000A0010000201020005559C6B610010000201020002300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像是一首令人眼花撩亂的愛情輪舞曲！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得這樣的故事如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF662F4E0099964EE44EBA773C82B164A94E827684611B60C58F2A821E66F2FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F9790196A23768465454E8B59824F55FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很不錯！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F884E0D932FFF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當真嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7576771F55CEFF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等，等等！\n剛才那是還不知道該怎麼收尾的點子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49FF0C7B497B49FF01000A525B624D90A3662F90844E0D77E590538A72600E9EBC65365C3E76849EDE5B50300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我還有另一個點子，\n有點長，不嫌棄的話<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就聽聽吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62119084670953E64E00500B9EDE5B50FF0C000A67099EDE9577FF0C4E0D5ACC68C476848A7100100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31807D807D5427300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "洗耳恭聽",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D178033606D807D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那還是算了吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39084662F7B974E8654270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只讓我看了想看的4隻寶可夢就要走人，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這樣很壞心耶。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8B936211770B4E8660F3770B7684003496BB5BF653EF59225C3189818D704EBAFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B390196A235F8858DE5FC38036300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，請聽。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8ACB807D300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷有兩個武鬥集團。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F767095169500B6B669B2596C65718300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一個是以<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>為始祖，\n運用剛硬招式的流派，<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>組。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00500B662F4EE5001000020102000470BA59CB7956FF0C000A904B7528525B786C62DB5F0F76846D416D3EFF0C00100002018B00017D44300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一個是以<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>為始祖，\n運用巧柔招式的流派<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>隊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00500B662F4EE5001000020102000570BA59CB7956FF0C000A904B75285DE767D462DB5F0F76846D416D3E0010000201000000968A300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這兩個流派以追求強大為宗旨，\n除了比試之外，不准有所交流。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195169500B6D416D3E4EE58FFD6C425F37592770BA5B9765E8FF0C000A96644E866BD48A664E4B5916FF0C4E0D51C6670962404EA46D41300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如有來往，就會被視為與<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>組、\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>隊雙方的所有寶可夢為敵。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這是一條幾乎會斷絕生路的嚴格戒律。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "598267094F865F80FF0C5C31670388AB899670BA820700100002018B00017D443001000A0010000201000000968A96D965B97684624067095BF653EF592270BA6575300200100001BE00000A9019662F4E00689D5E7E4E4E670365B77D55751F8DEF768456B4683C62125F8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "某天，這兩個流派決定要一較高下，\n於是推出了各自的代表。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>組的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以及<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>隊的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67D05929FF0C90195169500B6D416D3E6C7A5B9A89814E008F039AD84E0BFF0C000A65BC662F63A851FA4E86540481EA76844EE38868300200100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F00100002018B00017D4476840010000201020002FF0C00100001BE00000A4EE553CA0010000201000000968A76840010000201020003300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "輸了這場勝負的流派必須就地解散……\n但成為代表的2隻寶可夢卻藏著一個問題。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F384E869019583452DD8CA076846D416D3E5FC598085C31573089E3656320262026000A4F46621070BA4EE388687684003296BB5BF653EF5922537B85CF84574E00500B554F984C300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>與<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>是情侶，\n原來牠們已破了那條除了比試之外，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不准有所交流的戒律。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020102000282070010000201020003662F60C54FB6FF0C000A539F4F86726050115DF278344E8690A3689D96644E866BD48A664E4B5916FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D51C6670962404EA46D41768462125F8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在勝負的前一晚……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572852DD8CA07684524D4E00665A2026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>與<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>\n對上視線後立刻拔腿奔跑！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020102000282070010000201020003000A5C0D4E0A89967DDA5F8C7ACB523B62D4817F59548DD1FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱著寧死也不願分離的覺悟，\n一場愛的逃亡之旅就此展開。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B184575BE76B7B4E5F4E0D9858520696E2768489BA609FFF0C000A4E005834611B768490034EA14E4B65C55C316B645C55958B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我缺乏戀愛的經驗，所以實在沒辦法，\n戀愛劇的成分就是淡了點。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不過，這會是一個出色的故事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117F3A4E4F6200611B76847D939A57FF0C62404EE55BE657286C928FA66CD5FF0C000A6200611B52877684621052065C31662F6DE14E869EDE300200100001BE00000A4E0D904EFF0C90196703662F4E00500B51FA8272768465454E8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是說啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8AAA554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……就是說啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620265C31662F8AAA554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！我會完成它，\n然後拿去密阿雷出版社試試的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF01621167035B8C62105B83FF0C000A71365F8C62FF53BB5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E8A668A667684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳我除了感謝，還是感謝啊！\n要是小說暢銷的話，我會再拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3621196644E86611F8B1DFF0C9084662F611F8B1D554AFF01000A8981662F5C0F8AAA66A292B776848A71FF0C62116703518D62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD97684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    }
  ],
